    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "W LONGS\nWHOLESALE\nSPIRIT STORE\nBLACK BOY\nForge but locking South and Royal Hail.\nCANTASMenu",
      "Suet-scented\nwattle\nAUSTRALIAN REGIONAL WINES\nSELECTED FROM PRIVATE BINS EXCLUSIVE\nTO QANTAS\nDRY RED\nIne\nRed Wines\nare\nrenowned for\ngood colour,\ngenerous bouquet,\nfull flavour\nCanetes\nour flight cellar are\nexclusive to\nrepresent the best of our fine regional and varietal\nwines.\nMOSELLE\nThe\nwell-rounded\nflavour,\noverall\nAustralian\nearned for\nMoselle\nthis wine a justifiably high reputation.\nfeature of the\nQantas Private Bin Moselle,\nof Australia's best.\nCHABLIS\nThe charm and individuality of Australian Chablis\nHe In\nappealing\nflavour.\nsubtle bouquet\ncrisp,\nfinish.\nOur especially selected,\nand\nbottle-\naged Chablis shows these qualities at their peak.\nCHAMPAGNE\nThe hallmarks of Australian\nfresh\nChampagne\nare\nits\nbouquet,\nfull fruity\nflavour\nand distinctive,\ndry finish.\nThis wine is produced by the traditiona\nbottle\nfermentation\nprocess at\nconstant\ntemper-\nature\nin\nunderground\ncellars.\nQantas\nis\nproud\nto offer this fine example of Australian winemaking\nskill.\nFRENCH CHAMPAGNE\nThe pungent\nbouquet,\ndistinctive\nlingering finish mark\nthis outstanding\nEpernay district of\nFrance.\nCompletely\ndry, it is a refreshing drink at any time.\nLIQUEURS\nDrambuie\nCreme de Menthe\nCointreau\nCognac\nBenedictine\nTia Maria\nSF 53/29\nConsommé Madrilène\nou\nCrème d'Argenteuil\nGrosses Crevettes Frappées\nSauce Louis\nContre-Filet de Boeuf Grillé\nCoq au vin Blanc\nLégumes de Saison\nConsomme Madrilene\nCream of Asparagus Soup\nChilled Bay Jumbo Shrimps\nLouis Dressing\nCHOICE OF TWO HOT MAIN COURSES:\nNew York Cut Char Broiled Sirloin\nwith Baked Idaho Potatoes\nChicken Breast with White Wine Sauce\nFresh Seasonal Vegetables\nLonge de Porc Froide\nSalade Pomme de Terre\nSalade Bismark\nVinaigrette ou Sauce Roquefort\nDessert\nPlateau de Fromages Assortis\nAnanas Frais\nCafé Irlandais\nFriandises\nCold Roast Loin of Pork with Potato\nSalad and Apple\nSauce\nBismark Salad\nVinaigrette or Roquefort Dressing\nSelected Sweet Course\nCheese Platter\nHawaiian Pineapple\nIrish Coffee\nMint and Mandarin Slices\nLow Calorie Sweetener available on request.\nSelected Fish Course available on Friday.\nIf you would like this menu mailed to your home or to a friend, the Flight Hostess will arrange postage for you."
